WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
They were made by stupid people

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:04.160
that have cost their countries fortunes

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:07.640
and given those same countries no chance for success.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.120
If you don't get away from this green scam,

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.880
your country is going to fail.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:14.040
And I'm really good at predicting things, you know?

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.740
They actually said during the campaign they had a hat,

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:18.719
the best-selling hat.

00:00:18.719 --> 00:00:20.799
Trump was right about everything.

00:00:20.799 --> 00:00:22.680
And I don't say that in a braggadocious way,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:23.959
but it's true.

00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:25.719
I've been right about everything.

